# BeagleBone — Data Controller

Receives sensor frames from the sensor server and camera manager via named
pipes, fans out to all downstream subsystems: state registry, shared memory,
SQLite database, UART, and PIR-triggered camera capture.

## Source Files

| File | Description |
|:-----|:------------|
| `data_controller.c` | Main controller loop |
| `pipeline/pipe_reader.c` | Sensor server pipe reader |
| `pipeline/cam_pipe_reader.c` | Camera manager pipe reader |
| `pipeline/sensor_dispatch.c` | Sensor frame fanout — state, SHM, DB, UART, cam trigger |
| `pipeline/cam_dispatch.c` | Camera frame fanout |
| `state/state_registry.c` | Canonical state registry |
| `state/shm_updater.c` | Shared memory projection |
| `state/db_persist.c` | SQLite persistence |
| `uart/uart_staging.c` | UART frame staging |
| `uart/uart_transport.c` | UART transport layer |
| `uart/uart_controller.c` | UART communication to STM32 targets |
| `uart/uart_lock.c` | UART mutex |
| `doorbell/doorbell_pending.c` | Doorbell event pending state |
| `doorbell/doorbell_result_reader.c` | Doorbell SHM result consumer |
| `db_manager.c` | SQLite database interface |
| `heartbeat.c` | Device heartbeat tracking |
| `build_info.c` | Build timestamp |

## Dependencies

```bash
sudo apt install libsqlite3-dev:armhf
```

## Build

```bash
export ARCH=arm
export CROSS_COMPILE=arm-linux-gnueabihf-
cd ~/embedded-iot-hub/beaglebone/controller

${CROSS_COMPILE}gcc -g -O0 \
  data_controller.c \
  pipeline/pipe_reader.c \
  pipeline/cam_pipe_reader.c \
  pipeline/sensor_dispatch.c \
  pipeline/cam_dispatch.c \
  state/state_registry.c \
  state/shm_updater.c \
  state/db_persist.c \
  uart/uart_staging.c \
  uart/uart_transport.c \
  uart/uart_controller.c \
  uart/uart_lock.c \
  doorbell/doorbell_pending.c \
  doorbell/doorbell_result_reader.c \
  build_info.c \
  db_manager.c \
  heartbeat.c \
  -I./include -I. -I../inference/app -I../include \
  -o data_controller -lpthread -lrt -lm -lsqlite3

# Verify architecture
file data_controller
# Expected: ELF 32-bit LSB pie executable, ARM...
```

## Deploy

```bash
sudo systemctl stop data-controller sensor-server
scp data_controller debian@beaglebone.local:~/controller/data_controller
sudo systemctl start sensor-server data-controller
tail -f /var/log/data_controller.log
```

## PIR Camera Trigger

On a PIR 0→1 occupancy transition, `sensor_dispatch.c` sends a
`CamTriggerRequest` over a UNIX domain datagram socket to
`camera_manager` (`/tmp/cam_trigger.sock`). `camera_manager` looks up
the camera IP from its heartbeat registry and sends a UDP `CAPTURE`
packet directly to the camera on port 9091.

See `../include/cam_trigger_ipc.h` for the IPC contract.

## Unit Tests

```bash
cd ~/embedded-iot-hub/beaglebone/controller/tests/unit
rm -rf build && mkdir build && cd build
cmake .. && make && ./test_controller && ./test_db_tx
```
